<title>POLAND: PLI president resigns, deputy takes over.</title>
<headline>PLI president resigns, deputy takes over.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of Polish wholesaler and retailer Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) has accepted the resignation of president Piotr Polak and appointed deputy president Mariusz Gromek as his successor, PLI said.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement on Tuesday that Polak resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
